{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】杏花村嶺南中學一名男學生懷疑被同學拳打腳踢，警方以涉嫌普通襲擊拘捕三名男童。</p>\n<p>三人年齡介乎13至15歲，獲准保釋候查，須於12月中旬向警方報到。</p>\n<p>事發在周二下午，一名13歲男童在學校吃飯時被多人襲擊。校方稱已啟動危機處理機制，展開調查及聯絡家長，配合警方調查。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:23:35.526336+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T15:02:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T15:29:52.489650+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:16:59.830336+00:00","content_hash":"4475dcf09c4486cfdc364a0d213115b7b309806f65189db4b6c8e9a6cdfc99fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}